  "[action] (to Wang Lung) The second son leaves to establish a grain market.",
  "[action] The second son leaves to establish a grain market.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"And what now?\"",
  "the eldest son (to the second son): \"And I shall live a life of wealth and comfort. I will buy many houses, and I will live with my wife in the best of them.\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung demands an explanation for his sons' wealth.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son, the second son): \"Now why have you two grown rich?\"",
  "the second son (to Wang Lung): \"It is easy to make money. There is a new railway and a new road and the city needs food and the people need grain and I have bought grain from the land and I have sold it in the city. It is all simple, and the people who do not understand it do not see the truth.\"",
  "[action] The eldest son buys more houses.",
